---
import RecordDocument from '../../../components/record/RecordDocument.astro';
import BarChart from '../../../components/record/viz/BarChart.astro';
import StatusMatrix from '../../../components/record/viz/StatusMatrix.astro';
import { recordHref, recordRouteAtPath } from '../../../data/record';
import {
  governanceRegisterRetrievedAt,
  recordBoardSeats,
  recordGovernanceCounts,
  recordPolicyNotReportedCount,
  recordPolicyRegister,
  recordPolicyReportedCount,
  recordResourceUse,
  registerStatusCounts,
  registerStatusDefinition,
  resourceUseRegisterRetrievedAt,
} from '../../../data/record-registers';

const route = recordRouteAtPath('/record/governance/');

const namedSeatCount = recordBoardSeats.filter((seat) => seat.name !== null).length;
const seatMatrixRows = recordBoardSeats.map((seat) => ({
  label: seat.seat,
  values: [
    seat.name ?? null,
    seat.displayedRole ?? null,
    { value: registerStatusDefinition(seat.status).label, status: seat.status === 'not-reported' ? ('caution' as const) : ('neutral' as const), note: seat.limits },
  ],
}));
const policyBars = [
  { label: 'Reported on file with the state registration', value: recordPolicyReportedCount },
  { label: 'No published source on this site', value: recordPolicyNotReportedCount },
];
const resourceBars = registerStatusCounts(recordResourceUse).map((status) => ({
  label: status.label,
  value: status.count,
}));
---

<RecordDocument {route}>
  <section class="record-section container-fluid px-0" aria-labelledby="governance-brief-title">
    <div class="row align-items-end g-4 mb-4">
      <div class="col-lg-8">
        <p class="record-section__label mb-2">Governance worksheet</p>
        <h2 id="governance-brief-title">Publish the row, not a completed table.</h2>
        <p class="record-section__lede mb-0">This register carries the board seats and the policies a donor, a funder, or a board member would look for. Every row states what establishes it. The rows nothing establishes are published empty on purpose: a table that omits them reads as complete, and a reader cannot tell an unpublished policy from one that does not exist.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-4">
        <div class="alert alert-info mb-0" role="note"><strong>Evidence rule.</strong> A row marked “not reported” is a statement about the evidence, not about the institution. It does not say a control is missing; it says no public source here describes it.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-3" aria-label="Governance register summary">
      <div class="col-12 col-sm-4"><article class="card record-stat h-100"><div class="card-body p-3"><span class="record-kicker d-block mb-2">Board seats</span><strong class="record-stat__value d-block">{recordBoardSeats.length}</strong><span class="record-stat__label">seats listed; {namedSeatCount} named by a public source</span></div></article></div>
      <div class="col-12 col-sm-4"><article class="card record-stat h-100"><div class="card-body p-3"><span class="record-kicker d-block mb-2">Policies with a source</span><strong class="record-stat__value d-block">{recordPolicyReportedCount}</strong><span class="record-stat__label">of {recordPolicyRegister.length} policies this register carries</span></div></article></div>
      <div class="col-12 col-sm-4"><article class="card record-stat h-100"><div class="card-body p-3"><span class="record-kicker d-block mb-2">Register checked</span><strong class="record-stat__value d-block">{governanceRegisterRetrievedAt}</strong><span class="record-stat__label">the date the external record below was last opened</span></div></article></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="record-section container-fluid px-0 mt-5" aria-labelledby="governance-counts-title">
    <div class="row align-items-end g-4 mb-4">
      <div class="col-lg-8"><p class="record-section__label mb-2">Governance facts</p><h2 id="governance-counts-title">What the state filing reports.</h2></div>
      <div class="col-lg-4"><p class="small text-body-secondary mb-0">These are the strongest rows in this register: a state charitable-registration record states them. They are self-reported figures for a filing year, not a current roster.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="table-responsive border rounded bg-white" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Governance facts with their basis and limits">
      <table class="record-table table table-hover align-middle mb-0">
        <caption class="caption-top px-3 py-3">Governance fact, the source that carries it, and what that source cannot establish</caption>
        <thead class="table-light"><tr><th scope="col">Fact</th><th scope="col">Value</th><th scope="col">Basis</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Limit</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {recordGovernanceCounts.map((row) => (
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">{row.field}</th>
              <td><strong>{row.value}</strong></td>
              <td>{row.basis}</td>
              <td><span class:list={['badge', registerStatusDefinition(row.status).className]}>{registerStatusDefinition(row.status).label}</span></td>
              <td class="small text-body-secondary">{row.limits}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="record-section container-fluid px-0 mt-5" aria-labelledby="governance-seats-title">
    <div class="row align-items-end g-4 mb-4">
      <div class="col-lg-8"><p class="record-section__label mb-2">Board register</p><h2 id="governance-seats-title">Three seats, and what accounts for each one.</h2><p class="record-section__lede mb-0">The count above comes from a state filing that does not name anyone. The names below come from the institution&rsquo;s own public pages, which is a weaker basis, and each row says so.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card shadow-sm mb-4"><div class="card-body">
      <StatusMatrix
        level={3}
        id="governance-seat-matrix"
        title="Board seats as the record accounts for them"
        columns={['Name as published', 'Displayed role', 'Status']}
        rows={seatMatrixRows}
        description="An empty cell is a row the register is publishing empty, not a row it forgot. No degree, certification, or professional title is asserted for any name in this register."
        source="Institutional registers (SRC-008)"
        sourceHref={recordHref('/record/verify/')}
      />
    </div></div>
    <div class="table-responsive border rounded bg-white" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Board seats with their basis and limits">
      <table class="record-table table table-hover align-middle mb-0">
        <caption class="caption-top px-3 py-3">Board seat, the basis that carries it, and the limit that basis carries</caption>
        <thead class="table-light"><tr><th scope="col">Seat</th><th scope="col">Name as published</th><th scope="col">Displayed role</th><th scope="col">Basis</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Limit</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {recordBoardSeats.map((seat) => (
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">{seat.seat}</th>
              <td>{seat.name ?? <span class="text-body-secondary">Not reported</span>}</td>
              <td>{seat.displayedRole ?? <span class="text-body-secondary">Not reported</span>}</td>
              <td>{seat.basis}</td>
              <td><span class:list={['badge', registerStatusDefinition(seat.status).className]}>{registerStatusDefinition(seat.status).label}</span></td>
              <td class="small text-body-secondary">{seat.limits}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="record-section container-fluid px-0 mt-5" aria-labelledby="governance-policy-title">
    <div class="row align-items-end g-4 mb-4">
      <div class="col-lg-8"><p class="record-section__label mb-2">Policy register</p><h2 id="governance-policy-title">Every policy a reader would look for, including the ones with nothing behind them.</h2><p class="record-section__lede mb-0">The register carries five policies by name. One is reported to exist in a state filing without its text being published; four have no public source at all. Neither state is a statement that the policy does not exist.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-4 align-items-start">
      <div class="col-12 col-xl-7">
        <div class="table-responsive border rounded bg-white" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Policy register with basis, status and limits">
          <table class="record-table table table-hover align-middle mb-0">
            <caption class="caption-top px-3 py-3">Policy, what is published about it, the basis, and the limit</caption>
            <thead class="table-light"><tr><th scope="col">Policy</th><th scope="col">Published state</th><th scope="col">Basis</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Limit</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              {recordPolicyRegister.map((row) => (
                <tr>
                  <th scope="row">{row.field}</th>
                  <td>{row.value}</td>
                  <td>{row.basis}</td>
                  <td><span class:list={['badge', registerStatusDefinition(row.status).className]}>{registerStatusDefinition(row.status).label}</span></td>
                  <td class="small text-body-secondary">{row.limits}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-xl-5">
        <div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body p-3 p-xl-4">
          <BarChart
            level={3}
            id="governance-policy-basis"
            title="Policies by what establishes them"
            items={policyBars}
            unit="policies"
            description="Derived from the register beside it. The two bars are the two different things this page is trying to keep apart."
            source="Institutional registers (SRC-008)"
            sourceHref={recordHref('/record/verify/')}
          />
        </div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* The first-grant review, the donor's question and the board member's
    * question, in the same register shape as the rest of the room. Most of the
    * rows are published as absences, and that is the point: the ratio a funder
    * looks for and the approval behind it are carried in the same table, so the
    * flattering half cannot be read without the other one. */}
  <section class="record-section container-fluid px-0 mt-5" aria-labelledby="governance-resource-title">
    <div class="row align-items-end g-4 mb-4">
      <div class="col-lg-8">
        <p class="record-section__label mb-2">Resource use and measurement</p>
        <h2 id="governance-resource-title">What a first-grant review, a donor, and a board member each ask for.</h2>
        <p class="record-section__lede mb-0">A program officer opening a first grant asks how much of the money reaches program, who approved the figures, and how the work is measured. A donor asks where a gift goes and whether it is restricted. A board member asks whether a budget and a financial statement exist, and who signed them. This register carries those questions with the same basis-and-limit discipline as every other register here, and it publishes the ones nothing answers as absences rather than leaving them off the table.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-4"><div class="alert alert-info mb-0" role="note"><strong>Read the row next to it.</strong> The program-service share is a filing figure carried by a state record, and the approval basis behind this room&rsquo;s own measures is a management attestation. The register prints them in the same table because a reader who takes one without the other has an incomplete file.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-4 align-items-start">
      <div class="col-12 col-xl-7">
        <div class="table-responsive border rounded bg-white" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Resource use and measurement register with basis, status and limits">
          <table class="record-table table table-hover align-middle mb-0">
            <caption class="caption-top px-3 py-3">Question, what is published against it, the basis, and the limit that basis carries</caption>
            <thead class="table-light"><tr><th scope="col">Question</th><th scope="col">Published value</th><th scope="col">Basis</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Limit</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              {recordResourceUse.map((row) => (
                <tr>
                  <th scope="row">{row.field}</th>
                  <td>{row.value}</td>
                  <td>{row.basis}</td>
                  <td><span class:list={['badge', registerStatusDefinition(row.status).className]}>{registerStatusDefinition(row.status).label}</span></td>
                  <td class="small text-body-secondary">{row.limits}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="small text-body-secondary mt-3 mb-0">Register checked {resourceUseRegisterRetrievedAt}. The statutory route for requesting the institution&rsquo;s exemption application and its annual returns is the IRC §6104(d) path stated in the <a href={recordHref('/record/legal/')}>legal-status register</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-xl-5">
        <div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body p-3 p-xl-4">
          <BarChart
            level={3}
            id="governance-resource-basis"
            title="Resource-use rows by what establishes them"
            items={resourceBars}
            unit="rows"
            description="Derived from the register beside it. A row carried by a government filing, a row verified in the repository, and a row publishing an absence are counted separately, and a status the register does not use is shown at zero rather than dropped."
            source="Institutional registers (SRC-008)"
            sourceHref={recordHref('/record/verify/')}
          />
        </div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="record-section container-fluid px-0 mt-5" aria-labelledby="governance-boundary-title">
    <div class="card border-warning"><div class="card-body p-3 p-xl-4">
      <p class="record-kicker mb-2">Publication boundary</p>
      <h2 id="governance-boundary-title" class="mb-3">Keep the inference line visible.</h2>
      <p>This register does not reproduce private personnel material, board minutes, resolutions, or the text of any policy. Those may exist outside the public route graph; their publication authority and privacy review are not established here.</p>
      <p class="mb-0">A name on a public page establishes that the page says so. It does not establish an appointment, a term, a fiduciary duty, or a qualification, and nothing in this register should be read as establishing one.</p>
    </div></div>
  </section>
</RecordDocument>
